%% Master Application Flow — high-level overview only.
%% Drill down: 02 (user flows), 03 (auth), 04 (authz), 05 (api/data), 06 (routes),
%% 07 (account lifecycle), 08 (jobs/webhooks), 09 (error recovery), 10 (broken overlay).
flowchart TD
    classDef working fill:#1e7e34,color:#fff,stroke:#155724
    classDef broken fill:#b02a37,color:#fff,stroke:#7a1f28
    classDef untested fill:#6c757d,color:#fff,stroke:#495057
    classDef security fill:#e8590c,color:#fff,stroke:#a13a08
    classDef unknown fill:#adb5bd,color:#000,stroke:#6c757d,stroke-dasharray: 4 3

    Actor[Actor: anonymous / anon-Supabase / signed-in parent]:::working
    Entry[Entry point: cold start, deep link, or reconnect]:::working
    Route[Expo Router route<br/>see 06-route-navigation-map]:::working
    UIState[UI state]:::working
    Action[User/system action]:::working
    AuthCheck{requireAuth +<br/>AI-provider compliance gate<br/>see 03/04}:::working
    API[Express /api/* handler<br/>see 05-api-data-flow]:::working
    ServerLogic[Server logic: validation, safety-guard,<br/>rate limit, idempotency]:::working
    Downstream[(AI router / ElevenLabs / Sora /<br/>Supabase / Postgres)]:::working
    Response[HTTP response]:::working
    ClientState[Client state: AsyncStorage / React Query]:::working
    NextUI[Next UI state]:::working

    Actor --> Entry --> Route --> UIState --> Action
    Action -->|non-GET or private GET| AuthCheck
    Action -->|public GET| API
    AuthCheck -->|pass| API
    AuthCheck -->|fail: 401/503| Response
    API --> ServerLogic --> Downstream --> Response --> ClientState --> NextUI
    NextUI -.->|loop| UIState

    OfflineQueue[Offline interaction queue drain<br/>POST /api/sync/interactions]:::broken
    ClientState -.-> OfflineQueue
    OfflineQueue -->|404: route does not exist| Response

    Consent[COPPA consent gate<br/>see 04-authorization-flow]:::security
    Entry --> Consent
    Consent -->|unconsented| Route

    note1["10-broken-flow-overlay.mmd collects every\nBROKEN/SECURITY/UNKNOWN edge found in this audit"]:::unknown
